Package: fosos-cli
Version: 0.2.5
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: apt, sudo
Recommends: polkitd
Maintainer: FosOS <dev@fosos.local>
Description: fos command and passwordless admin for sudo users
 Provides fos for updating, upgrading, installing, removing, and repairing
 packages. APT remains available for every other operation. Members of the
 sudo group may use sudo and polkit (pkexec) without a password when polkitd
 is installed; login and lock screen still use the account password.
